ult?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Yes, if you find any discrepancy in the result, you can <strong data-end=\"858\" data-start=\"837\">submit objections</strong> within the given timeframe on the official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>When will the Bihar Board Class 10th results be declared?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The <strong data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1167\">results</strong> are expected to be announced in <strong data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1211\">March 2025</strong>, after reviewing objections to the answer key.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Bihar Board 10th Compartmental Answer Key 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-19001 size-large\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"574\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1-1024x574.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1-1024x574.jpeg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1-300x168.jpeg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1-768x431.jpeg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1-1536x861.jpeg 1536w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-26-at-4.00.10-PM-1.jpeg 1600w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?